				<article id="post-105399" class="post-105399 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-place ak-article clearfix" data-type="post" data-id="105399" data-url="https://seenews.tw/105399" data-title="南市議員尤榮智陪女兒尤淨寬登記參選   象徵藍營曾文區服務薪火相傳">
	<div class="ak-article-inner">
